      "Preserve actual public release and connectionReady admission before Start.",
      "Attempt all original application Stops before retrying a failing browser or manager close; retain errors without allowing stderr reporting to bypass cleanup.",
      "Retain ownership of managed child and both log handles until cleanup completes; same-owner close can retry and repeated SIGTERM reaches the same pending child.",
